int it is it is  if greater benefit for you to stop the  process  to throw away that starting material and  put in a new batch and start your second  batch  you'll only know what that time is by  doing trend analysis  with trend analysis you get to optimize  the timing for your entire extraction  process  so this is where a limbs and an in-house  testing lab  are extremely important which is for the  optimization of your entire process  with trend analysis you can optimize the  time for decarboxylation  for winterization and for extraction  trend analysis you get the optimization  extraction process you can visualize  your gmp  you can ensure that you're getting a  consistent cbd and terpene profile  and it provides you with a detailed  overview of the performance  of your laboratory enabling you to  compare your yields to other extraction  labs  so that the lab manager can then take  corrective actions  so using a limbs gives you more accurate  results  greater productivity a higher quality  and more consistent product  and lower cost since you've been able to  optimize your yields  as well as throughput and finally you  have a happy extraction lab  you have a reduction in compliance  failures you have higher throughput and  higher yields  you have a wide product range since  you're able to create new formulations  using your in-house testing lab  and you have a reputation for  consistency of the final product among  customers  so i hope that this has been useful to  you and that you've  learned the reasons why extraction labs  in my opinion  should all have in-house testing and how  a limbs can help you  thank you very much

